{"id":87,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its entire body is a snowy white. Unharmed by even intense cold, it swims powerfully in icy waters."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It swims through the ocean at a speed of eight knots, searching for Pokémon that will become its prey. It’s especially fond of Wishiwashi."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Dewgong loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this Pokémon sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its streamlined body has little drag in water. The colder the temperature, the friskier it gets."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"Its body is covered with a pure white fur. The colder the weather, the more active it becomes."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its streamlined body has low resistance, and it swims around cold oceans at a speed of eight knots."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It loves frigid seas with ice floes. It uses its long tail to change swimming direction quickly."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"It stores thermal energy in the body. It swims at a steady eight knots even in intensely cold waters."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It sleeps under shallow ocean waters during the day, then looks for food at night when it's cold."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Stores thermal energy in its body. Swims at a steady 8 knots even in intensely cold waters."}],"abilities":[{"name":